                                                                       '"lens_distortion", '
                                                                       '"reflection_or_transparency"}, each '
                                                                       'true or false)\n'
                                                                       'category_profile (up to 6 short '
                                                                       'strings on what must be protected '
                                                                       'for this category)\n'
                                                                       'supplier_dimensions (dimensions '
                                                                       'printed on the image, exactly as '
                                                                       'written)\n'
                                                                       'unclear_membership\n'
                                                                       'unknowns\n'
                                                                       'conflicts\n'
                                                                       'cropped\n'
                                                                       'occluded\n'
                                                                       'blocking_question\n'
                                                                       '\n'
                                                                       'Each piece entry must contain:\n'
                                                                       '{\n'
                                                                       '  "label": "...",\n'
                                                                       '  "kind": "...",\n'
