                                                 "colour should be shown.', selection: 'Please confirm which "
                                                 "pieces belong to this job.', instructions: 'Please rewrite "
                                                 "your instructions in short, simple points.' };\n"
                                                 '// P1.8: the token counts of the conflict check, when it '
