                                                 "o.relations.join('; ') : 'not a set, or not recorded') + "
                                                 "'.',\n"
                                                 "  'Must be absent: ' + (st.exclusions.length ? "
                                                 "st.exclusions.map(x => x.item).join('; ') : 'nothing "
