                                                 "  'Client choices, fixed for scene shots: ' + "
                                                 "(choices.length ? choices.join('; ') : 'none given') + '. "
                                                 "' + (st.people_text || 'People: none in any shot.') + ' ' "
                                                 "+ (st.plant_text || ''),\n"
                                                 "  'Lead: ' + LEAD[st.lead] + '.',\n"
                                                 "  'A shot of kind white is the catalogue master, fixed by "
                                                 'the studio: the product alone on plain white with neutral '
                                                 'studio light, at the angle of the vendor photo, no props '
                                                 'and no room; the client choices do not apply to it. Shots '
                                                 'of kind hero, wide and detail show one and the same room '
                                                 'on purpose. A shot made from another shot repeats its '
                                                 "room, arrangement, Midas pieces and person on purpose.',\n"
                                                 "  'Scene rules, fixed by the studio: a scene shows only "
                                                 'the product, the room shell (walls, floor, ceiling, '
                                                 'windows with plain sheer curtains or blinds, doors, fixed '
                                                 'architectural details and built-in light) and planned '
                                                 'Midas pieces. No generic props. Each scene shot has a '
                                                 'fixed light preset and a fixed camera view (below); the '
                                                 'plan follows them. Warm or evening light comes from the '
                                                 'built-in light; a lamp or a rug appears only as a planned '
                                                 "Midas piece.',\n"
                                                 "  'Category guidance (' + st.profile.name + '): ' + "
                                                 "(st.profile.guide ? st.profile.guide + ' These are "
                                                 'composition guidelines, not evidence of the source '
                                                 'inventory. Original images and explicit owner corrections '
                                                 "take precedence.' : 'none recorded.'),\n"
                                                 "  'Midas shortlist (the only Midas products allowed; "
                                                 "nothing else may appear): ' + (short.length ? short.map(c "
                                                 "=> c.sku + ' ' + c.name + ' (' + c.kind + (c.fixed ? ', "
                                                 "client pick, must appear' : '') + ')').join('; ') : "
                                                 "'none') + '. At most ' + maxMidas + ' different Midas "
                                                 "pieces across the job.',\n"
                                                 "  ...(st.shots.some(x => x.plan && x.plan_ok) ? ['Shots "
                                                 'already checked, shown for consistency only (one room '
                                                 'keeps one light direction; client picks and the Midas '
                                                 'limit count across the job). Do not return entries for '
