                                                 "x.plan_ok).map(x => 'Shot ' + x.n + ' (output ' + "
                                                 "x.output_id + ', kind ' + x.kind + '). Setting: ' + "
                                                 "(x.plan.setting || 'none') + ' Light: ' + (x.plan.light || "
                                                 "'none') + ' Midas pieces: ' + (x.plan.midas_pieces.length "
                                                 "? x.plan.midas_pieces.map(m => m.count + ' x SKU ' + "
