                                                 '// Owner, 16 Oct 2026, 21:28: a scene approved by eye '
                                                 'follows the same rule as the white master: "Approved by '
                                                 'the studio · not reviewed"\n'
                                                 "// in the manifest and the owner's view; the client sees "
