                                                 'quality; each saved file read back, its edge rows checked '
                                                 'at 255 and the background checked for a grey halo. No AI; '
                                                 'nothing redrawn. The approved master in Drive is '
                                                 "unchanged.';\n"
                                                 "  pk.background_note = 'background set to 255' + (wc.fit "
