                                                     'Use unclear_membership for pieces whose membership in '
                                                     'the product set is uncertain.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Use unknowns for details the photograph cannot '
                                                     'establish.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Use conflicts when visible evidence contradicts other '
                                                     'visible evidence or printed information.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Use blocking_question for one short question a person '
                                                     'must answer before images can be made, or null.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'OUTPUT\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Return exactly one valid JSON object. No markdown. No '
                                                     'explanation. No additional text.\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Keep every string short. Give no coordinates and no '
