                                                     '  "seen_whole": true,\n'
                                                     '  "role": "product"\n'
                                                     '}\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'Valid roles: "product", "excluded", "context".\n'
                                                     '\n'
                                                     'All required keys must be present. Use empty arrays '
                                                     'when no entries apply.',
