                                                     'silhouette, proportions, upholstery pattern, '
                                                     'stitching, seams, piping, trims, legs, arm shape, '
                                                     'hardware, and visible construction '
                                                     'features.\\n\\nInclude the observed colour of each '
                                                     'relevant detail.\\n\\nRecord only what the photograph '
                                                     'supports.\\n\\nSIDED PARTS\\n\\nRecord product pieces '
                                                     'with a visible left or right configuration, such as a '
                                                     'chaise, a one-arm module, or a corner unit.\\n\\nState '
                                                     'the hand as seen when facing the piece (left-arm '
                                                     'facing or right-arm facing) and, separately, its '
                                                     'position in the image.\\n\\nThe hand must never be '
                                                     'mirrored. Do not infer handedness when it cannot be '
                                                     'established.\\n\\nRELATIONSHIPS\\n\\nDescribe up to 5 '
                                                     'visible relationships between product pieces, for '
                                                     'example two chairs beside a table, a chaise connected '
                                                     'to a sofa, a nightstand beside a bed, a mirror above a '
                                                     'dresser.\\n\\nDo not infer unseen '
                                                     'connections.\\n\\nSHOWN WITH\\n\\nshown_with lists '
                                                     'things resting on or in the product that are not '
                                                     'product pieces, for example bedding on a bed, throw '
                                                     'pillows on a sofa, decor on a '
                                                     'dresser.\\n\\nUNCERTAINTY\\n\\nUse unclear_membership '
