                  "// The owner's conditions:\n"
                  '// 1. Reuse the logic of "Claude · Midas white clean-up" (MSU2K5WKKfizCapW): its '
                  'background sample from the outer edge band, its\n'
                  '//    near-white test (darkest channel at least 205, channels within 30), its white point '
