                                                 'check): two page shapes are read.\n'
                                                 '// - The A7 page draft sends colour, material, details to '
                                                 'keep and things to exclude under `metadata`.\n'
                                                 '// - The client first page sends top-level `outcomes`, '
                                                 '`delivery` (ratio, views, resolution) and `details` (sku, '
                                                 'dimensions, colour, fabric,\n'
                                                 '//   inventory, customPrompt). Its shape labels are '
                                                 'translated as `aspect` is; it never falls back to 16:9. A '
                                                 'request without a job id is\n'
                                                 '//   still refused. Every field that A7 does not use is '
                                                 'listed back under "not applied".\n'
                                                 "const job = p.job && typeof p.job === 'object' ? p.job : "
