                                               'how many pieces there should be: count what you see.\n'
                                               'Return one JSON object only, no other text, with these '
                                               'keys:\n'
                                               'category: short phrase for the product type.\n'
                                               'pieces: array with one entry for each separate physical '
                                               'piece you can see. Each entry: {"label": short name, "kind": '
                                               'generic kind such as armless seat, corner seat, chair, '
                                               'table, nightstand, cushion, bookend, "box": [ymin, xmin, '
                                               'ymax, xmax] in 0-1000 image coordinates, "seen_whole": true '
                                               'or false, "role": "product" or "excluded" or "context"}. A '
                                               'piece marked with a cross or struck out has role excluded. '
                                               'Objects that only sit on or around the product (books, '
                                               'bedding, plants, a vase) have role context. An inset view, a '
                                               'second angle, a mirrored view, a diagram or a swatch is '
                                               'never a piece.\n'
                                               'count_by_kind: array of {"kind", "count"} for role product '
                                               'only; it must agree with the pieces list.\n'
                                               'views_not_pieces: array of short strings for inset views, '
                                               'alternate angles, diagrams and swatches.\n'
                                               'signs: array of {"sign": "cross" or "arrow" or "circle" or '
                                               '"printed_count" or "printed_label" or "swatch" or "inset" or '
                                               '"other", "text": what is written or drawn, "meaning": most '
                                               'likely meaning}.\n'
                                               'printed_counts: array of {"text", "item", "count"} for '
                                               'numbers of pieces printed on the image.\n'
                                               'colour_observed: colour of the main product itself as '
                                               'photographed. Never take it from a swatch, a fabric sample, '
                                               'a cushion or another colourway option.\n'
                                               'swatch_colours: array of colours that appear only on '
                                               'swatches, fabric samples or other colourway options; empty '
                                               'when there are none.\n'
                                               'material_appearance: appearance only, never a certified '
                                               'composition.\n'
                                               'design_locks: array of the shapes, patterns, trims, hardware '
