                                                 '}\n'
                                                 '// Side views (owner, 16 Oct 2026, decision 27, as revised '
                                                 '06:49): a Left side or Right side image is made only when '
                                                 'a supplied photo shows\n'
                                                 '// that side; otherwise that image is held in stage 07 and '
