                                                 "'owner document MI 21-26' },\n"
                                                 "      default: { height_cm: '120', guides: '', basis: "
                                                 "'owner 16 Oct 2026 (D9): 120 cm for room-scale furniture "
                                                 "only' },\n"
                                                 '      // Tabletop accessories and lamps (owner, 16 Oct '
                                                 "2026, D9): the camera near the product's mid-height "
